    "element_id": "nvidia_test_subset_text_26",
    "doc_name": "nvidia_test_subset",
    "page_number": 2,
    "element_type": "text",
    "content": "•\nThe NVIDIA Hopper GPU architecture and ramp of the first products based on the architecture, including the \nNVIDIA H100 Tensor Core GPU",
