  {
    "element_id": "nvidia_test_subset_text_28",
    "doc_name": "nvidia_test_subset",
    "page_number": 2,
    "element_type": "text",
    "content": "◦\nNVIDIA DGX Cloud, an AI supercomputing service that gives enterprises immediate access to the \ninfrastructure and software needed to train advanced models for generative AI and other \ngroundbreaking applications. NVIDIA has partnered with leading cloud service providers to host these \nservices in their data centers",
